WEBVTT

00:00.652 --> 00:03.168
Your invoices, your customers, your receipts.

00:03.208 --> 00:04.303
It’s your bookkeeping!

00:04.343 --> 00:06.665
So why should it live with someone else?

00:07.202 --> 00:08.567
This is Huismus!

00:08.607 --> 00:11.865
Bookkeeping for freelancers, right on your own computer.

00:12.119 --> 00:14.031
At a glance you see what’s still open,

00:14.071 --> 00:17.454
what you earned this year, and which quote is waiting for an answer.

00:17.919 --> 00:19.984
An invoice takes just a few clicks.

00:20.024 --> 00:23.455
Pick a customer, type what you did, and Huismus adds up the total.

00:23.495 --> 00:25.828
Issue it, and it gets a fixed number!

00:29.419 --> 00:31.869
Save photos of your receipts in a folder,

00:31.909 --> 00:33.042
even from your phone.

00:33.082 --> 00:35.334
Huismus picks them up, and you check them.

00:35.952 --> 00:37.542
Import your bank statement.

00:37.582 --> 00:41.410
Huismus puts every payment next to your invoices and expenses.

00:41.986 --> 00:44.022
Your whole year on one screen!

00:44.062 --> 00:46.223
Revenue, costs and profit.

00:46.263 --> 00:47.288
Charging VAT?

00:47.328 --> 00:50.586
Then the amounts for your return are ready every quarter.

00:51.219 --> 00:53.786
Coming from Moneybird, another package or Excel?

00:53.826 --> 00:55.571
Bring all your years with you!

00:55.611 --> 00:59.857
Huismus does a trial run first, and only saves when you say so.

01:00.286 --> 01:03.492
Huismus runs on your Mac, your PC, or your own server.

01:03.532 --> 01:04.720
Completely free!

01:04.760 --> 01:06.674
No subscription, and no account.

01:06.714 --> 01:07.642
And your data?

01:07.682 --> 01:09.656
It simply stays with you.

01:12.252 --> 01:13.107
Huismus.

01:13.147 --> 01:15.640
Your bookkeeping, on your own computer!
